# Configure base_url and bt1_token in your private HTTP client environment.
# This Provider must explicitly support openai-responses.
### JSON response; state flags are forcibly normalized by the gateway
POST {{base_url}}/v1/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{bt1_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"fiber-demo","input":"Hello","store":true,"background":true}

### SSE; clients carry the complete history on every turn
POST {{base_url}}/v1/responses
Authorization: Bearer {{bt1_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"model":"fiber-demo","input":[{"role":"user","content":"Hello"},{"role":"assistant","content":"Hi"},{"role":"user","content":"Continue"}],"stream":true}
